@startuml
title Change Password Sequence (/api/auth/me/password)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Change Password UI" as ChangePasswordUi
control "AuthNotifier\n(FE Controller)" as FeController
entity "ChangePasswordRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as BeChangePasswordDto
control "AuthController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "IAuthService" as IAuthService
control "AuthService" as AuthService
control "IPasswordHasher" as IPasswordHasher
entity "User" as UserEntity
entity "UserAuth" as UserAuthEntity
control "IAuthAccountRepository" as IAuthAccountRepository
control "AuthAccountRepository" as AccountRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over ChangePasswordUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Mobile UI file exists: profile_screen.dart. BE request DTO exists: ChangePasswordRequest.
Endpoint is PUT /api/auth/me/password and returns bool in the response envelope.
Entities exist: User and UserAuth.
Interfaces used in code: IAuthService, IPasswordHasher, IAuthAccountRepository.
end note

Learner -> ChangePasswordUi: Enter current and new password
Learner -> ChangePasswordUi: Submit password change
ChangePasswordUi -> FeController: changePassword(current, new)
FeController -> BeController: PUT /api/auth/me/password\ncurrentPassword, newPassword
BeController -> BeChangePasswordDto: Bind request body
BeChangePasswordDto --> BeController: ChangePasswordRequest
BeController -> BeController: Check authenticated user
BeController -> IAuthService: ChangePasswordAsync(userId, command)
IAuthService -> AuthService: ChangePasswordAsync(userId, command)
AuthService -> IAuthAccountRepository: FindByIdAsync(userId)
IAuthAccountRepository -> AccountRepository: FindByIdAsync(userId)
AccountRepository -> DbContext: Query user auth
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT users\nJOIN user_auth
MySQL --> DbContext: User auth row or null
DbContext -> UserEntity: Read User
DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Read UserAuth
UserEntity --> DbContext: User
UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: Password hash
DbContext --> AccountRepository: Account auth data
AccountRepository --> AuthService: Account auth data

alt User not found or current password invalid
    AuthService -> AuthService: Verify current password
    AuthService --> BeController: Validation failure
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 400 error
    FeController --> ChangePasswordUi: Show password error
else Password accepted
    AuthService -> IPasswordHasher: Hash new password
    AuthService -> IAuthAccountRepository: UpdatePasswordAsync(userId, hash)
    IAuthAccountRepository -> AccountRepository: UpdatePasswordAsync(userId, hash)
    AccountRepository -> DbContext: Find UserAuth
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_auth
    MySQL --> DbContext: UserAuth row
    DbContext -> UserAuthEntity: Read UserAuth
    UserAuthEntity --> DbContext: UserAuth
    AccountRepository -> UserAuthEntity: Set PasswordHash
    UserAuthEntity --> AccountRepository: UserAuth updated
    AccountRepository -> DbContext: Save password change
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE user_auth
    MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
    DbContext --> AccountRepository: Save result
    AccountRepository --> AuthService: Password updated
    AuthService --> BeController: Success result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 200 OK
    FeController --> ChangePasswordUi: Show success
end

@enduml
